# "Other tapped creatures you control": Bot2's Ornithopter attacks in turn four and stays tapped through Bot1's turn five, yet
# has no hexproof (the ability is only for its controller's creatures), so Bot1's Lightning Bolt can target and kill it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
The Wandering Rescuer
Plains
Plains
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Wandering Rescuer.Cast(Convoke: Ornithopter, Ornithopter, Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Plains
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
